<title>CHINA: Perwaja Terengganu launches new $400 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Perwaja Terengganu launches new $400 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Chartered Bank on Friday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PERWAJA TERENGGANU SDN BHD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GOVERNMENT OF MALAYSIA</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$400 MLN  COUPON    LIBOR+15BP MATURITY   5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	 *	  LAUNCH    11.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    --	    REPAYMENT   BULLET   REPLIES   15.JUL.97</p>
<p> RATING     --	    SALES LMTS  STANDARD DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF     YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH/MALAYSIAN		    HOME CTRY MALAYSIA</p>
<p> FEES	 15 BP FLAT</p>
<p>MANAGEMENT LEVELS AND COMMITMENT</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS	  US$50 MLN+   ALL-IN 18 BP</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$25-45 MLN ALL-IN 18 BP</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		US$10-20 MLN ALL-IN 18 BP</p>
<p> SOLE ARRANGER   STANDARD CHARTERED BANK</p>
<p> NOTES   *THE NOTES ARE CALLABLE AT THE END OF YEAR THREE AND</p>
<p>	    THEREAFTER ON INTEREST PAYMENT DATES.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
